 "text": "Cheat code #1 = Previous Day High &amp; Low Zones ✅\n\nThese are the 2 most powerful areas of support &amp; resistance on a day to day basic!\n\nHere's the cheat sheet ⬇️\n\nTrend days...\n\nAbove PDH = Focus on calls 📈\nBelow PDL = Focus on puts 📉\n\nRange days...\n\nReject PDH = Focus on puts 📉 https://t.co/40nVqHGqlX",
